    "text": "Hi team, getting this error during full load + cdc in one of the tables\n```error occurred while reading records: error occurred while waiting for connections: thread[zenmaster_new.sms_campaigns_min[30]-max[\u003cnil\u003e]]: failed to close writer: failed to close writer: context canceled: prev error: failed to write records: failed to send batch: rpc error: code = Internal desc = grpc: error while marshaling: string field contains invalid UTF-8```\nDDL for table:\n```CREATE TABLE `sms_campaigns` (\n  `id` bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` blob,\n  `merchant_id` bigint NOT NULL,\n  `status` enum(\n    'scheduled',\n    'started',\n    'ended',\n    'draft',\n    'no balance',\n    'deleted',\n    'queued',\n    'approval_declined',\n    'approval_awaiting',\n    'insufficient_credits',\n    'invalid_reward',\n    'error',\n    'picked',\n    'completed',\n    'fallback_ready',\n    'editted',\n    'retry_ready'\n  ) DEFAULT 'draft',\n  `sender` text,\n  `send_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `customers_selected` bigint DEFAULT '0',\n  `customers_reached` bigint DEFAULT '0',\n  `message` varchar(10000) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,\n  `msg_type` enum('Transactional', 'Promotional') DEFAULT NULL,\n  `is_test_campaign` int DEFAULT NULL,\n  `append_stop_link` int DEFAULT NULL,\n  `dlt_template_id` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `required_credits` int DEFAULT NULL,\n  `is_forced` tinyint(1) DEFAULT '1',\n  `filters` varchar(1000) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `no_balance_count` bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `customers_converted` bigint DEFAULT '0',\n  `customers_location_fail` int NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `msm_id` bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `user_id` bigint DEFAULT NULL,\n  `filter_id` bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `offer_id` bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `reward` varchar(1000) DEFAULT 'na',\n  `reward_expiry` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `unicode_message` enum('on', 'off') NOT NULL DEFAULT 'off',\n  `customers_dnd_fail` int NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `customers_invalidphone_fail` int NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `customers_network_fail` int NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `customers_coupon_fail` int NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `customers_dlt_template_fail` int DEFAULT '0',\n  `customers_fill_incomplete` int DEFAULT '0',\n  `customers_blocked` int DEFAULT '0',\n  `batches_suppressed` int DEFAULT NULL,\n  `batches_noinput` int DEFAULT NULL,\n  `batches_failed` int DEFAULT NULL,\n  `revenue_generated` double DEFAULT '0',\n  `claim_count` bigint DEFAULT '0',\n  `credits_used` int DEFAULT '0',\n  `total_sms_sent` int DEFAULT '0',\n  `updated_on` datetime DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  `created_on` datetime DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  `run_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `is_image` int DEFAULT NULL,\n  `image_url` varchar(500) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `abenabled` int DEFAULT '0',\n  `abpercentage` int DEFAULT '0',\n  `trackdays` int NOT NULL DEFAULT '7',\n  `approved_by` bigint DEFAULT NULL,\n  `approval_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `cta_url` varchar(500) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `notification_status` longtext,\n  `error_id` bigint DEFAULT NULL,\n  `vendor_id` mediumtext,\n  `error_reason` varchar(5000) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_bin DEFAULT NULL,\n  `tracking_urls` text,\n  `dlt_header` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `gamified_templates` text,\n  `last_fallback_time` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  KEY `idx_send_time` (`send_time`)\n) ENGINE = InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET = latin1```\nIt's unclear from logs which column to look for invalid UTF-8, also if data is available in MySQL then it should be replicated either by sanitising UTF-8",
